<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Supplier Registration</title>
<style>
body{font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-bottom:12px}
th,td{border:1px solid #000;padding:6px}
th{background:#f2f2f2}
h2,h3{text-align:center}
.logo{text-align:center;margin-bottom:10px}
.no-record{text-align:center;font-style:italic}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="logo">{{#if logo}}<img src="{{logo}}" style="max-height:80px;background:#1b1b31;" alt="Logo">{{/if}}</div>
<h2>SUPPLIER REGISTRATION FORM</h2>

<h3>Supplier Reference Information</h3>
<table><tr><td>Supplier Reference ID</td><td>{{defaultValue basicDetails.supplierId}}</td></tr></table>

<h3>Basic Details</h3>
<table>
<tr><td>Company Name</td><td>{{defaultValue basicDetails.companyName}}</td></tr>
<tr><td>Location</td><td>{{defaultValue basicDetails.city}}</td></tr>
<tr><td>Country</td><td>{{defaultValue basicDetails.country}}</td></tr>
<tr><td>Address</td><td>{{defaultValue basicDetails.address1}},{{defaultValue basicDetails.city}},{{defaultValue basicDetails.state}} - {{defaultValue basicDetails.postalCode}} </td></tr>
<tr><td>Email</td><td>{{defaultValue basicDetails.emailId}}</td></tr>
<tr><td>Supplier Mobile Number</td><td>{{defaultValue basicDetails.phone}}</td></tr>
<tr><td>Legal Entity Type</td><td>{{defaultValue basicDetails.legalEntityType}}</td></tr>
<tr><td>Business Expiry Date</td><td>{{defaultValue expiryDate}}</td></tr>
<tr><td>Place of Issue</td><td>{{defaultValue basicDetails.placeOfIssue}}</td></tr>
<tr><td>Incorporation Date</td><td>{{defaultValue incorporationDate}}</td></tr>
<tr><td>Annual Revenue</td><td>{{defaultValue basicDetails.annualTurnOver}}</td></tr>
<tr><td>License Number</td><td>{{defaultValue basicDetails.licenseNo}}</td></tr>
<tr><td>Currency</td><td>{{defaultValue basicDetails.turnOverCurrency}}</td></tr>
<tr><td>Payment Terms</td><td>{{defaultValue basicDetails.paymentTerms}}</td></tr>
<tr><td>GST/VAT Number</td><td>{{defaultValue basicDetails.taxRegNo}}</td></tr>
<tr><td>TIN Number</td><td>{{defaultValue basicDetails.taxPayerId}}</td></tr>
<tr><td>Working Hours</td><td>{{defaultValue basicDetails.workingTimeStartTime}} - {{defaultValue basicDetails.workingTimeEndTime}}</td></tr>
<tr><td>Working Days</td><td>{{defaultValue basicDetails.workingdayStart}} - {{defaultValue basicDetails.workingdayEnd}}</td></tr>
<tr><td>Tax Effective Date</td><td>{{defaultValue taxEffectiveDate}}</td></tr>
<tr><td>Pan Number</td><td>{{defaultValue basicDetails.panNo}}</td></tr>
</table>

<h3>Contact Details</h3>
<table><tr><th>Name</th><th>Role</th><th>Category</th><th>Number</th><th>Email</th><th>Tag</th></tr>
{{#if contacts}}{{#each contacts}}<tr><td>{{defaultValue contactName}}</td><td>{{defaultValue designation}}</td><td>{{defaultValue contactCategory}}</td><td>{{defaultValue mobile}}</td><td>{{defaultValue email}}</td><td>{{defaultValue isPrimary}}</td></tr>{{/each}}{{else}}<tr><td colspan="6" class="no-record">No records available</td></tr>{{/if}}
</table>

<h3>Scope Of Supply</h3>
<table>
<tr><td>Service Experience</td><td>{{defaultValue basicDetails.brandName}}</td></tr>
<tr><td>Domestic Experience</td><td>{{defaultValue basicDetails.yearOfExpLocMarket}}</td></tr>
<tr><td>International Experience</td><td>{{defaultValue basicDetails.yearOfExpInternational}}</td></tr>
</table>

<h3>Goods / Services</h3>
<table><tr><th>Category</th><th>Sub Category</th></tr>
{{#if goodsServices}}{{#each goodsServices}}<tr><td>{{defaultValue category}}</td><td>{{defaultValue subCategory}}</td></tr>{{/each}}{{else}}<tr><td colspan="2" class="no-record">No records available</td></tr>{{/if}}
</table>

<h3>Banking Details</h3>
<table><tr><th>Account</th><th>Bank</th><th>Name</th><th>Country</th><th>City</th><th>Tag</th></tr>
{{#if bankDetails}}{{#each bankDetails}}<tr><td>{{defaultValue accountNo}}</td><td>{{defaultValue bankName}}</td><td>{{defaultValue beneficiaryName}}</td><td>{{defaultValue country}}</td><td>{{defaultValue city}}</td><td>{{defaultValue tag}}</td></tr>{{/each}}{{else}}<tr><td colspan="6" class="no-record">No records available</td></tr>{{/if}}
</table>

<h3>Documents</h3>
<table><tr><th>Name</th><th>Attachment</th></tr>
{{#if documents}}{{#each documents}}<tr><td>{{defaultValue docType}}</td><td>{{defaultValue filename}}</td></tr>{{/each}}{{else}}<tr><td colspan="2" class="no-record">No records available</td></tr>{{/if}}
</table>


<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
<h3>DECLARATION ON CONFLICT OF INTEREST</h3>
<p><strong>To</strong></p>
<p><strong>{{defaultValue orgData.organization_name}},<br>
{{defaultValue orgData.org_email}},<br>
{{defaultValue orgData.org_legal_address}}<br></strong>

<p>This is to certify that we, M/s <strong>{{defaultValue basicDetails.companyName}}</strong> are having the following entities / persons in actual or potential conflict of interest while dealing with </strong>{{defaultValue orgData.organization_name}}</strong>.</p>
<table><tr><th>Name &amp; Designation of the entity / person in conflict of interest</th><th>Name of <strong>{{defaultValue orgData.organization_name}}</strong> person to whom related to</th><th>Nature of relationship / conflict</th></tr>
<tr><td>NIL</td><td>NIL</td><td>NIL</td></tr>
<tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td></td><td></td></tr></table>
<p><strong>Note -</strong> In case there is no conflicts to be declared, please clarify state as NIL in the first row and strike out the balance lines.</p>
<p>This is to further certify that, we M/s <strong>{{defaultValue orgData.organization_name}}</strong>:</p>
<ol><li>Are not dealing with <strong>{{defaultValue orgData.organization_name}}</strong> under any other name or through any other subsidiary / associate companies other than the list disclosed above.</li><li>None of our other directors / business partners / other proprietors is dealing with <strong>{{defaultValue orgData.organization_name}}</strong> under any other company name.</li><li>None of the other directors / business partners / proprietors / employees holding a position of responsibility and / or authorized to transact with <strong>{{defaultValue orgData.organization_name}}</strong> has any significant financial interest or other relationship i.e., (Father, Mother, Brother, Sister or any other close family relationship) with any other <strong>{{defaultValue orgData.organization_name}}</strong> employee or directors of <strong>{{defaultValue orgData.organization_name}}</strong> of companies.</li><li>We further declare that as and when there is any change to the above certification, we shall intimate to <strong>{{defaultValue orgData.organization_name}}</strong> about such changes in the status. Any concerns regarding this to the notice of your chief ethics officer on the email id <strong>{{defaultValue orgData.org_email}}</strong>.</li></ol>
<p>This is to certify that the above said information is true to the best of my knowledge and that I have the requisite authority to sign above said declaration in my capacity as:</p><br/><br/>
<table><tr><th>Designation / Capacity</th><th>ID / Employee Number</th></tr><tr><td style="height:35px;"></td><td></td></tr></table>
<p>Regards,</p>
<table><tr><th>Authorized Signatory Name</th><th>Title / Designation</th></tr><tr><td style="height:35px;"></td><td></td></tr></table>
<p><strong>Signature:</strong> ___________________________</p>
<p><strong>Date:</strong> ___________________________</p>
</body></html>